1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,809
23-爆音.

2
00:00:00,809 --> 00:00:04,930
I wrenched the wheel, turning off the highway onto a desolate gravel road.

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:11,959
The sign was rusted, a skeleton of metal barely visible in the sweep of my headlights: Clearwater Psychiatric Facility.

4
00:00:11,959 --> 00:00:13,250
It wasn't a hospital.

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:18,096
It was a warehouse for broken things, a dumping ground for the Family's liabilities.

6
00:00:18,096 --> 00:00:23,152
We used it for people who knew too much to live freely, but couldn't be killed for political reasons.

7
00:00:23,152 --> 00:00:25,737
Or for blood relatives who had lost their minds.

8
00:00:25,737 --> 00:00:29,991
It was a place where people checked in and never checked out.Ilene saw the sign.

9
00:00:29,991 --> 00:00:31,821
The crying stopped instantly.

10
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:34,652
Then, the screaming began."No.No.

11
00:00:34,652 --> 00:00:36,954
You can't put me in there.I'm not crazy.

12
00:00:36,954 --> 00:00:41,839
" "You orchestrated a kidnapping to destroy a marriage," I said, my voice devoid of emotion.

13
00:00:41,839 --> 00:00:44,105
"You hallucinated threats where there were none.

14
00:00:44,105 --> 00:00:47,172
You are a danger to yourself and everyone around you.

15
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:48,416
" I pulled up to the gate.

16
00:00:48,416 --> 00:00:50,922
The guards recognized my vehicle immediately.

17
00:00:50,922 --> 00:00:53,613
They opened the heavy iron gates without a word.

18
00:00:53,613 --> 00:00:57,152
I drove up to the main entrance where two orderlies were waiting.

19
00:00:57,152 --> 00:00:59,571
They were massive men.Silent men.

20
00:00:59,571 --> 00:01:00,955
I unlocked the doors.

21
00:01:00,955 --> 00:01:05,962
"Get out. " "No. " Ilene clung to the leather upholstery."Ethan, please.I'm sorry.

22
00:01:05,962 --> 00:01:09,098
I'll apologize to her.I'll do anything." I didn't wait.

23
00:01:09,098 --> 00:01:12,646
I exited the vehicle and strode to her door, ripping it open.

24
00:01:12,646 --> 00:01:14,712
I grabbed her arm and hauled her out.

25
00:01:14,712 --> 00:01:20,000
She went limp, becoming dead weight as I dragged her, her heels scraping uselessly through the gravel.

26
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,727
The orderlies stepped forward and took her from me.One on each arm.

27
00:01:23,727 --> 00:01:26,516
"Mr. Bruce," one acknowledged with a curt nod.

28
00:01:26,516 --> 00:01:30,840
"She is to have no visitors," I commanded."No phone calls.No mail.

29
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,884
As far as the world is concerned, she doesn't exist.

30
00:01:33,884 --> 00:01:36,074
" "Understood. " "Ethan. " Ilene shrieked.

31
00:01:36,074 --> 00:01:38,827
She twisted in their iron grip, reaching for me.

32
00:01:38,827 --> 00:01:43,627
Her eyes were wide, filled with a primal terror that finally mirrored what Aurora must have felt.

33
00:01:43,627 --> 00:01:45,357
"You owe me." she screamed.

34
00:01:45,357 --> 00:01:49,016
"My father saved your life. " I met her gaze, my eyes cold.

35
00:01:49,016 --> 00:01:50,625
"He saved my life," I said.

36
00:01:50,625 --> 00:01:53,069
"And I just spared yours.The debt is paid.

37
00:01:53,069 --> 00:01:55,082
" I turned my back on her."Ethan.

38
00:01:55,082 --> 00:01:56,770
Don't leave me here.It's dark.

39
00:01:56,770 --> 00:01:58,002
I'm afraid of the dark."

40
00:01:58,002 --> 00:02:01,751
Her voice cracked, dissolving into a raw, animalistic sound.

41
00:02:01,751 --> 00:02:03,156
I returned to the car.

42
00:02:03,156 --> 00:02:05,900
I slid into the driver's seat.I slammed the door.

43
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:09,858
The heavy glass and steel instantly severed the sound of her screaming.

44
00:02:09,858 --> 00:02:13,890
I watched through the rearview mirror as they dragged her through the double doors.

45
00:02:13,890 --> 00:02:15,993
The doors swung shut.She was gone.

46
00:02:15,993 --> 00:02:18,357
I sat in the silence for a long time.

47
00:02:18,357 --> 00:02:20,783
My hands were still tacky with Leo's blood.

48
00:02:20,783 --> 00:02:22,075
My shirt was ruined.

49
00:02:22,075 --> 00:02:23,806
I had destroyed my enemies.

50
00:02:23,806 --> 00:02:25,489
I had avenged the insult.

51
00:02:25,489 --> 00:02:27,638
I had cleaned house.I was the victor.
